# The Dockerfile generates its own dataset/model during the build (see
# Dockerfile comments), so these are never COPYd in — excluding them here
# just avoids uploading a large local data/models tree (which could include
# a 260MB+ trained transformer) into the Docker build context for nothing.
data/
models/
docs/
